 to 2025, 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids. October to November came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle, January to February came in at 50% of normal and May to June at 144%. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 26% of normal on the middle, and grid 17299 shows a preliminary estimate of 77.2 for July to August 2026.</p>"}
